# One line away from aa-counter-guard: once the opponent has shown
# aircraft, an anti-air turret (600cr, 250 reach, air-only) joins the cover
# beside structures. The gap it closes is total -- the whole army and the
# ground turret declare canAttackFlyingUnits: false, so before this arm
# nothing the bot could place touched an aircraft at all
# ([[policy-holding-ground]]).

name aa-counter-guard-aa
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 1
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
